      "type": "text",
      "id": "text-29",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 616,
      "width": 870,
      "height": 32,
      "text": "current term. The election restriction (voters reject a shorter/older log) is what",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text-30",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 648,
      "width": 870,
      "height": 32,
      "text": "keeps a stale leader from ever overwriting committed state.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
